    "physicalNotes": [
      "Form Q1 leads to 2.54 mm centers without stressing the package. Pin 1 emitter is I11, pin 2 base is I12, and pin 3 collector is I13.",
      "CIN positive goes to the BASE node; COUT positive goes to COLLECTOR. Use insulated pigtails for the 2 mm pitch capacitors.",
      "Use current-limited 12 V and a grounded, zero-offset 1 kHz input at 10 mV peak."
    ]
